From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: subarr-subgen <subarr@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:00:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0070: bump patch rev to v4.40

Moves the rev past upstream's v4.40. This fork's v4.40 carries upstream's
0065 (/batch skip_reasons) plus the fork's Parakeet backend (0064, 0067,
0068) and per-request translate naming (0069). Upstream's own rev bump
(its 0066, v4.39 -> v4.40) is not in this series because the fork never
carried upstream's v4.39 bump; this patch replaces both.
---
 subgen.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/subgen.py b/subgen.py
index b839600..edaabe7 100644
--- a/subgen.py
+++ b/subgen.py
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ subgen_version = '2026.08.1'
 # [v4.3 PATCH] subarr-subgen patch-stack revision, surfaced via /queue so subarr
 # can detect our extended capabilities (audio_language_override, etc.) and
 # degrade gracefully against vanilla mccloud/subgen which lacks them.
-subarr_subgen_patch_rev = 'v4.38'
+subarr_subgen_patch_rev = 'v4.40'
 
